The Spanish word forms in data/es/lexicon.tsv (and dict.fst built from it)
are derived from the RLA-ES Spanish spelling dictionary, version 2.9
(es.dic / es.aff, "español general"):

  Recursos Lingüísticos Abiertos del español (RLA-ES)
  Santiago Bosio and contributors
  https://github.com/sbosio/rla-es
  https://github.com/sbosio/rla-es/releases/download/v2.9/es.oxt

