The Source Code Form of the word list is the RLA-ES dictionary above;
tools/lang/es.sh regenerates the derived files from it (it expands every
affix of es.dic / es.aff, keeps verb forms with enclitic pronouns only where
the corpora attest them, adds attested diminutives, superlatives and -mente
adverbs and frequent subtitle words, and drops one-letter symbols).

